pub.dev only accepts dart_pkg 1.0.0 from a run that a `push` or `workflow_dispatch` event starts, and a `release` event started this run on `refs/tags/dart_pkg/v1.0.0`; start the publish workflow from tag pushes (`on: push`) instead of `on: release`, or publish it with `gh workflow run publish.yml --repo owner/repo --ref dart_pkg/v1.0.0`
